  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FMO loan will serve for the financing of a hydropower mini-grid portfolio in rural Kenya, as part of a larger facility with ElectriFi, which will provide a USD2 MLN senior debt facility. The portfolio will consist of eight hydro power plants forming five mini grids totalling 2.3MW of which two interconnected plants are already online.</narrative>
  </description>
